t(37, 270, """One day we will all depart .. One day we will not be here .. One day everything will, Allah willing, be more beautiful and sweeter""")

t(37, 1345, """I will surely return, mother .. by my Lord's will .. Tomorrow will be more beautiful .. I will wash away the shame, mother""")

t(37, 2445, """Where will you go?""")

t(38, 2075, """Patience, our brothers in the airports .. Seeking asylum and searching for life with the other .. oppression .. fear .. sorrow .. It is nearly over, Allah willing""")

t(39, 685, """15 years of your life may pass .. 20 years .. less or more, while you strive for one thing only .. how to enter the West .. and you fail .. even though the effort of 20 years may seem to you a very great deal, and that effort is the consumption of a lifetime and of an entire energy .. But .. to every young man or man this picture represents .. know that you remained so that you see the suffering with your own eyes .. so that you live the suffering yourself .. so that you grasp all the details .. not to hear of it from afar while you are in luxury or at ease .. To every man who tried to flee the reality of the Arab world .. and tried to jump from the ship of the Arab world, sinking for 100 years, but could not jump from the boat .. and whose life passed while he was in the boat wrestling with the waves of death without pause .. waves of poverty, fatigue, exhaustion and misery .. This is the plan of your destiny .. Take from it what is useful .. Leave frustration .. Leave the gloomy picture .. Stop focusing on the empty part of the glass .. You are here in the region because the air here makes something different from the air in the west of the earth and its east .. And tomorrow you will find the scent of Yusuf .. Tomorrow you will find it""")

t(39, 2140, """It is nearly over, Allah willing, O young men""")

t(40, 705, """Detaining refugees in cities, forbidding them to move outside them and confining them, like house arrest, within the bounds of a village of two or three streets, on flimsy pretexts of no value in the code of morals: this was an experience that lasted about 7 continuous years .. What I want to say is that the manifestations of injustice on earth are very many .. Much, very much of it is hidden from people .. Little, little, little of it is known to people! Imprisoning a human being merely because he sought refuge, protection and shelter is injustice, not justice! The personal experience does not concern me here .. What concerns me is the suffering of people that still goes on .. those who still live this injustice! Who are seared by its fire! You are victims, and the global order is definitely the cause. The global order has not had mercy on humanity, and humanity has not had mercy on itself .. The victims are every weak one .. every poor one .. everyone who has lost his homeland .. every exile .. everyone robbed of his rights .. The victims are the majority .. And among the victims there will not usually be a man of wealth, a man with a respected homeland, a man with a government official behind him or a man with someone influential behind him .. Being downtrodden inside the homeland in poor countries is also house arrest .. Poverty is house arrest .. Helplessness is house arrest .. Children crying because of a torn shoe they wear to school is house arrest .. Being homeless in the streets after divorcing the wife because of poverty is house arrest .. Most people today are under house arrest, and deliverance is not in the present global order""")

t(40, 2230, """We were children and an egg was enough for us .. We did not look for snacks .. body pollutants in juices of ill repute .. chips that destroy immunity .. sweets with disastrous, malignant colourings and flavourings .. The greatest harm we consumed was the lollipop, and not every day .. Watch over your children, please .. Watch over the little ones .. Protect them from a savage world that offers them every day what destroys their health.

The shop in the picture: I passed by it a year ago .. May Allah have mercy on Uncle Mustafa .. Perhaps I thought I would find him standing behind the refrigerator as he was 45 years ago, to hand me the egg .. If you love something today .. enjoy it, for time moves fast .. His children did not want to erase his memory .. They closed the shop and would not agree to rent it to anyone after him; they renewed its sign and wrote on it .. al-Mustafa .. May Allah have mercy on Uncle Mustafa,, Muhammad Hijazi Street, branching off Wadi al-Nil Street.""")

t(41, 1170, """In the seventies of the last century whooping cough spread widely .. Many people today are in a state of spreading terror on the channels .. Every day: such and such will happen .. we will be struck by such and such .. Whooping cough in the seventies was also an epidemic, so the world is used to epidemics and the matter is nothing new .. Personally I caught whooping cough in early childhood, when it was widespread in Egypt .. and I also caught the 2019 variant .. So there is no call for exaggeration and for spreading terror among people .. As someone who was struck by two epidemics, nearly died in the first and nearly died in the second: what is the use of frightening people? And what is the use of spreading this terror except seeking unlawful gain and devouring unlawful money from YouTube through this frightening? Pay no heed to the devourers of the unlawful .. They are only amusing themselves at your expense .. and making money at the cost of your mental health and your peace of mind""")

t(41, 2520, """Family relations between siblings are either beautiful, enjoyable and beneficial, easing for the siblings the harshness of life, or they""")

t(42, 60, """deviate in satanic directions .. Unfortunately, in many existing cases factions have become rife among siblings .. a group against a group, or all against one .. Unfortunately Satan has nested in the homes .. Minds have deviated .. behaviour has been corrupted .. The interference of others in wrecking relations between siblings is a reality .. Worse still, in cases some of which I witnessed and which reached me long ago and recently, mothers and fathers set out, by planning, premeditation and intent, to wreck their children's relations with one another .. Mothers and fathers who hate a particular son or a particular daughter and so encourage the rest of their children to wrong the son or daughter they hate! The reality is bitter, very bitter, and people have lost the compass .. Consciences are ruined .. feelings have dried up .. The accusations Satan has planted in souls that do not fear Allah have multiplied, and Satan's whisperings of false accusations, which have no reason at all to exist in the mind, have also become rife among people .. As I have said repeatedly .. the world has been hijacked by Satan.""")

t(42, 1435, """A word to mothers and fathers .. If your child chose the book, know that you have a child who will bring you much joy or much pain! How you look at this matter is what will determine whether he will be a joy or a pain! The child who chooses the sweets will submit to you easily, but does fatherhood or motherhood mean that children submit to us? He will submit to you if you are the kind of fathers or mothers who seek their children's submission to them! The child who chooses the book will not submit to you! But your desire for his submission will make him a pain to you .. Your knowing the meaning of true fatherhood and true motherhood will make him a joy to you! In all cases there are two states .. Every state is a choice .. and every outcome is a choice, then a test .. A choice and a test!""")

t(43, 220, """The eighties, and before them the seventies, meant the simplicity of people .. the simplicity of tools .. the simplicity of minds .. the simplicity of everything .. The seventies and eighties were kidnapped and put in a heavily guarded prison .. and the nineties and two-thousands were set free like two terrifying beasts, unleashed on people to change and distort human nature .. The seventies, and even the sixties, could have continued with a simple, slow development, because man lived for thousands of years developing very slowly .. developing at a slowness that suits the nature of his creation .. suits his human make-up .. But the nineties and two-thousands were someone's doing .. an accelerated, intended development .. very intended .. The nineties and two-thousands are a complete exception on earth to all that man has passed through .. Even 100 years ago life was developing slowly .. Returning the seventies to man is a great good for humanity, because they are the midpoint between before man reached the stage of being rid of the basic obstacles of life and able to reach the features of the nineties, and the stage of the tyranny of the nineties .. We ask Allah the Exalted to grant humanity the seventies once again.""")

t(43, 1730, """The real meaning of parliament in domestic politics is that it is the hall of daily scandals .. scandals of laxity, scandals of negligence, scandals of bribery, and exposing all the practices of the government from the lowest-ranking employee to the highest-ranking employee .. The scandals of municipalities .. hospitals .. clinics .. schools .. kindergartens .. etc .. Every mistake that goes on, happens and occurs daily .. This is the important role of any parliament in the world .. To make the Ummah know daily what is going on, what is happening and where the fault is .. The truth is that parliaments do not do this in an intensive, daily and detailed way, because they focus on the role of administrative legislation .. When parliament is an exposer and a revealer, it corrects many matters on the ground""")

t(44, 550, """Everyone who pours evil for another will inevitably be given to drink what he poured""")

t(44, 1625, """Al-Qahtani is a man who emerges at the end of time after the Mahdi; he will be severe with people, stern with them. To those who asked me about his time, this is the answer to their question.. Al-Qahtani emerges only in the time of the prophet of Allah, Isa, peace be upon him.""")

h(44, 2100, """- "After the Mahdi comes al-Qahtani; by Him who sent me with the truth, he is not inferior to him."
Summary of the hadith scholar's ruling: its chain is weak
Narrator: Jabir al-Sadafi | Hadith scholar: Ibn Hajar al-Asqalani | Source: Fath al-Bari by Ibn Hajar
Page or number: 6/631""")

t(45, 215, """There is no might and no power except with Allah .. One of our brothers, a channel owner, is posting and telling people: the victory of the Ummah begins from my channel, so spread the channel .. and if you spread my channel the Ummah will be victorious and you will see that with your own eyes, so why not try .. There is no might and no power except with Allah.. The Ummah is floundering and, as I said, the tear has grown too wide for the patcher .. The Ummah is not given victory by a channel, and the decrees of Allah, our Great Lord, do not need a channel in order to come to pass. This is a very deficient understanding of Allah the Exalted and a mistaken understanding of the meaning of decree .. Personal matters are close to causes, though causes do not govern them .. But public matters .. the events of history .. begin from a channel?! A channel which, if spread, will be the beginning of the Ummah's victory?!! This is a mistaken understanding of many things .. of how the decrees of Allah work .. of what decrees are and what their definition is .. of the laws of Allah on earth .. Then it is a flattening, belittling and shrinking of the decrees of Allah in the great events.. and a misunderstanding of the reality of succession on earth .. For me to be a famous doctor while I am in a village with a population of 10 people, even if I posted a thousand posters on the walls inside the village I would not become a famous doctor .. Decree must move this doctor to the state of light, not the state of specialisation .. For doctors are in the millions, but those whose work has light in it are counted on the fingers .. Those who offer the world something, even if they are in a village inhabited by 10 people, the world will come to them where their houses are in the village, to take shade with them under the shade of a beneficial tree that the world felt was beneficial .. But for a doctor who offers nothing distinctive to say: make me known to the world .. make a billion people see me and see my picture, my place and my address, what use is that in the decree of Allah?! I find a sad state of not understanding many things among brothers who speak on the issues of the end of time; they put themselves to trial and put people to trial with them.""")

h(45, 1100, """Not like this! Not like this do the decrees of Allah the Exalted work""")

t(45, 1880, """I was asked to interpret a vision that caused a stir two days ago, belonging to a brother, a channel owner, named Abdulaziz al-Qahtani. It has 3 symbols .. sacks of wheat that he left in the vision, saying to them: at their time I will return to them; the second symbol is an army of small, weak dwarfs .. and the third is a plump young girl.. The brother unfortunately did not understand his vision, and the vision put him to trial .. As for al-Qahtani, he comes in the time of the prophet of Allah, Isa, peace be upon him, and it will be a time of good which is now stored up for that time. This is the interpretation of the sacks of wheat the brother saw and said he would return to at their time. The army of dwarfs means the end of the military powers in the world, for it is known that al-Qahtani fights no one .. And the third symbol is the plump Arab woman, and in that there are meanings, the highest of which is a stable, fixed world in which there is no movement and no clamour, because the plump one's movement is slow. This is what is known of the time of al-Qahtani: he is after the Mahdi and comes in a time when most of humanity has died, life has gone back two thousand years, and the world has announced its farewell.

The brother did not understand the interpretation of his vision, so he put himself to trial and told people: I am going out to liberate the Islamic world; and he will begin to build mistaken actions upon his mistaken understanding .. So he had to be advised to pay attention to the correct interpretation of his vision, for it is clear that he did not understand his vision well. This is a reply at the request of several brothers who asked for his vision to be explained .. and at the same time advice to our brother, for whom we hope nothing but every good and soundness of affairs, and for every Muslim man and woman.

A whisper: I wish one of our brother's followers would tell him that I entered his channel to listen to him and advertisements of immodestly dressed women appeared to me in his videos!""")

t(46, 180, """J: crime .. H: right .. Kh: failure .. D: state .. Worshipping parents instead of Allah""")

t(46, 1310, """J: crime .. H: right .. Kh: failure .. D: state .. Worshipping parents instead of Allah""")

